  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safe and Fair: Realizing women migrant workers&apos; rights and opportunities in the ASEAN region (Spot Light initiative)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Overall objective: Labour migration is safe and fair for all women in the ASEAN region Specific objective 1: Women migrant workers are better protected by gender-sensitive labour migration governance frameworks; Specific objective 2: Women migrant workers are less vulnerable to violence and trafficking and benefit from coordinated responsive quality services; and Specific objective 3: Data, knowledge and attitudes on the rights and contributions of women migrant workers are improved &lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
